      "content": "so i finally did it. i got the promotion, the corner office, the whole thing. everything i spent the last ten years working for is right here in front of me. \n\nand i feel absolutely nothing. it just feels like i climbed a mountain just to realize there's nothing on the other side. i'm just... tired. of everything.",
